            "slot": "s488",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Beef protein isolate is hydrolyzed fro…",
            "text": "Beef protein isolate is hydrolyzed from grass-fed beef and refined to 90%+ protein — a clean, neutral powder rich in the amino acids that rebuild muscle and connective tissue: tendons, ligaments, joints. It's the structural half of the scoop, the part that repairs more than muscle alone.",
