            "repere": "Paragraphe · Egg white rounds out the profile where…",
            "text": "Egg white rounds out the profile where beef runs lean — leucine and the sulfur-containing aminos — and carries the highest DIAAS score of any common food. Together the scoop clears the 2–3g leucine threshold that switches on muscle repair. It digests clean, with no fat and no carbs riding along.",
